  "design": "Supported brick-heated stoneware steam digester, open feed hopper, mechanically driven canister press and real fixed inlet/outlet. Current functions include ore/waste recovery, water washing, steam separation and waste canister packing/unpacking; no invented shale mining.",
  "surface_plan": [
    "Individual fired bricks and darker soot at stoke arch/flue",
    "Glazed stoneware retort and acid channel, low-metallic roughness and mineral wear",
    "Hopper worked copper with folded rim/rivets; iron hoops on pressure chamber",
    "Timber press uprights with long-grain UVs, end grain at cuts and bolted shoes",
    "Bronze bored bearings, iron piston/rod/cam, continuous hemp transmission belt",
    "Worked paving rather than natural boulders; no generic enclosing machine box"
  ],
